This repository holds metadata only: for each text listed in an issue of the Official Gazette of Palestine
(Al-Waqa'i' al-Filastiniyya) its title, type, number, year, gazette issue and date. No text of any law is copied and no
descriptive text of the source is copied. The facts come from the issue index of Al-Muqtafi, Institute of Law, Birzeit
University (http://muqtafi.birzeit.edu/pg/), retrieved 29 October 2026.

عن منظومة القضاء والتشريع في فلسطين - المقتفي -، اعداد معهد الحقوق في جامعة بيرزيت.
Al-Muqtafi states that its material is copyrighted and may not be copied without permission. No Palestinian
provision exempting laws from copyright was found, so no law text is published here. Birzeit University does not
endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
